{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Eb]When they had finished the [Bb]work
[Ab]They brought the rest of the [Eb]money
[Ab]To make vessels [Eb/G]for service
[Cm]And articles of [Bb]gold and sil[Ab]ver
Throughout Jehoiada’s [Eb/G]life
[Ab]Burnt offerings were [Cm]presented
Continually in [Bb]the house of the [Eb]LORD
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
The house of [Ab]God was re[Eb]stored
And the [Bb]burnt offerings contin[Cm]ued
[Ab]Faithful hands rebuilt [Eb/G]the walls
And the [Ab]sacred things re[Eb]turned
{end_of_verse}

